This ticket (gh-1507) is authored by the same pipeline (presumably a PO/BA decomposition of #1406). The ticket's claims about the current state ("no producer calls the dispatcher — no SM rule, no root agent config, no workflow reference") were TRUE at authoring time but the gh-1471 in-job redesign (merged via PR #1481?) already wired the producers. The ticket text itself even says "the pool rides behind the existing review entry" — matching what's now in the code.

